diff --git a/docs/development.md b/docs/development.md
index 0bca076..b5a8f23 100644
--- a/docs/development.md
+++ b/docs/development.md
@@ -60,6 +60,12 @@ DATABASE_ADAPTER=mysql bin/ci
 
 The remote CI pipeline will run tests against both SQLite and MySQL.
 
+### Storage usage
+
+`Board#bytes_used` reads a persisted total; `Account#bytes_used` sums its boards’ totals. Each card image and each file attachment in a board description, card description, or comment contributes its blob’s byte size. Reads do not scan attachments or access file storage.
+
+Totals are eventually consistent: workers refresh the affected card or board description after commit. The migration queues a resumable backfill for existing data, and imports queue one for the imported account. To run the backfill again, use `bin/rails storage_usage:rebuild`.
+
 ### Outbound Emails
 
 You can view email previews at http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/rails/mailers.
